sequenceDiagram
    participant Trigger as Sale simulator / Dashboard
    participant Inv as DynamoDB: Inventory
    participant RC as Reorder Checker Lambda
    participant Open as DynamoDB: OpenRFQs
    participant Agent as AgentCore Runtime (Strands Agent)
    participant Vend as DynamoDB: Vendors / VendorStock-*
    participant RFQ as DynamoDB: RFQs
    participant SES as Amazon SES

    Trigger->>Inv: decrement quantity_on_hand
    Inv-->>RC: DynamoDB Streams event
    RC->>RC: quantity_on_hand crossed below reorder_threshold?
    RC->>Open: is an RFQ already open for this SKU?
    alt already open
        RC-->>RC: skip (idempotent)
    else needs reorder
        RC->>Agent: invoke_agent_runtime(prompt: reorder SKU X)
        Agent->>Vend: list_candidate_vendors(sku)
        Vend-->>Agent: vendors ranked by trust
        loop until a vendor has enough stock
            Agent->>Vend: check_vendor_stock(vendor, sku, qty)
            Vend-->>Agent: sufficient? yes/no
        end
        Agent->>RFQ: create_rfq(sku, qty, vendor)
        RFQ-->>Agent: RFQ written, OpenRFQs claimed
        Agent->>SES: send RFQ email to vendor
    end
